/P 88 0 R
/E (In our previous community update, we presented water chemistry findings at one outfall in Sutton Park. We should clarify this particular outfall contains inputs from both Combined Sewer Overflows \(CSO\) and \(separate\) surface water sewers. This surface water outfall is the only one where we've spotted pollution during recent visits. We have continued collecting water chemistry and will draw on different evidence to investigate any potential pollution sources, but nothing unexpected has been measured so far.)
